{
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "id": "StoneTablet_1_01",
      "character": "narrator",
      "content": "第六诫：“海不喧哗，却能淹没一切喧嚣。争吵的人，听不到潮汐的指引。”",
      "nextId": "StoneTablet_1_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "StoneTablet_1_02",
      "character": "protagonist",
      "content": "这句话.......是什么意思？",
      "nextId": "StoneTablet_1_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "StoneTablet_1_03",
      "character": "protagonist",
      "content": "这石碑上，有个海螺？",
      "nextId": "StoneTablet_1_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "StoneTablet_1_04",
      "character": "protagonist",
      "content": "呃嗯嗯——（尝试拔下来）",
      "nextId": "StoneTablet_1_05"
    },
    {
      "id": "StoneTablet_1_05",
      "character": "protagonist",
      "content": "竟然和这个石碑黏在一起了吗？明明看起来就像随手放上去的......",
      "nextId": "StoneTablet_1_06"
    },
    {
      "id": "StoneTablet_1_06",
      "character": "protagonist",
      "content": "好像有声音？（凑近）",
      "nextId": "StoneTablet_1_07"
    },
    {
      "id": "StoneTablet_1_07",
      "character": "narrator",
      "content": "（海螺中传出一段旋律）",
      "effects": [
        {
          "PlaySfx": "shell_melody_01"
        }
      ],
      "nextId": "StoneTablet_1_08"
    },
    {
      "id": "StoneTablet_1_08",
      "character": "protagonist",
      "content": "要是能复现这段旋律，说不定会发生什么......",
      "nextId": "end"
    }
  ]
}